.git
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
*.zip

# Regenerated by the web-build stage in Dockerfile.api - no need to
# ship stale copies in the build context.
src/Aerie.Api/wwwroot/dashboard

# Secrets - never bake these into an image (widened build context now reaches
# the repo root, where local secrets live; the running container gets its own
# copy via a mount/env, not a baked-in one)
.env.json
**/.env.json

# Python tooling working directories (src/Aerie.Trading/, docs/plans/trading.md
# Phase 0b). Same reasoning as **/node_modules above, and the same urgency: the
# API build context is the repo root, and .venv holds the linters plus pyright's
# bundled Node - a few hundred megabytes uploaded to the daemon on every build
# of an image that has no Python in it.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
